{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T16:56:25+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-28T16:56:25+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Revenio Group Oyj","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Devices","country":"Finland","city":"Vantaa","website":"https://www.reveniogroup.fi","employees":765,"summary":"Revenio Group Oyj, provides ophthalmological devices and software solutions for the diagnosis of glaucoma, macular degeneration, and diabetic retinopathy in Finland, the United States, and internationally. The company offers iCare IC100, ST500, and IC200 tonometers; iCare HOME2, a tonometer to measure eye pressure; iCare Sensors that are accessories of iCare tonometer for measuring intraocular pressure (IOP); iCare TONOVET Pro, a tonometer designed for use in surgical or emergency settings; and iCare TONOVET Plus tonometer, which is used by veterinarians, ophthalmologists and other personnel to measure intraocular pressure in animal patients. It also provides imaging devices comprising iCare EIDON, a device with confocal retinal imaging; iCare DRSplus, a device for pupil imaging; and iCare COMPASS, which provides fundus perimetry with true-color confocal retinal images. In addition, the company offers iCare ILLUME, a screening software that helps to detect the early signs of diabetic retinopathy, age-related macular degeneration, and glaucoma using artificial intelligence; iCare CLINIC cloud software to store long-term IOP data; and Oculo, an eye care software platform, which combines clinical communication, telehealth, remote patient monitoring and data analytics capabilities. Revenio Group Oyj was incorporated in 2001 and is based in Vantaa, Finland.","exchange":"Helsinki","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Revenio Group Oyj, fournit des dispositifs ophtalmologiques et des solutions logicielles pour le diagnostic du glaucome, de la dégénérescence maculaire et de la rétinopathie diabétique en Finlande, aux États-Unis et à l'échelle internationale. La société propose des tonomètres iCare IC100, ST500 et IC200; iCare HOME2, un tonomètre pour mesurer la pression oculaire; iCare Sensors qui sont des accessoires d'iCare tonomètre pour mesurer la pression intraoculaire (IOP); iCare TONOVET Pro, un tonomètre conçu pour une utilisation en chirurgie ou en situation d'urgence; et iCare TONOVET Plus tonomètre, qui est utilisé par les vétérinaires, les ophtalmologistess. Il fournit également des dispositifs d'imagerie comprenant iCare EIDON, un dispositif d'imagerie rétinienne confocale; iCare DRSplus, un dispositif d'imagerie pupillaire; et iCare COMPASS, qui fournit des images rétiniennes confocales en couleur réelle.","summary_fr_excerpt":true},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":433591616,"shares_outstanding":42096274,"trailing_pe":25.121952,"forward_pe":13.376624,"price_to_book":2.067028,"ev_to_ebitda":27.453,"ev_to_revenue":4.438,"dividend_yield":0.0,"payout_ratio":0.0,"beta_yahoo":0.919},"targets":{"current_price":10.3,"mean":14.8,"median":14.6,"high":16.5,"low":13.5,"n_analysts":4,"reco_mean":1.0,"reco_key":"strong_buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-12"],"eps_avg":0.09333,"eps_low":0.06,"eps_high":0.14,"revenue_avg":60775000,"ex_dividend":"2025-04-11","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.06706,"institutions_pct":0.44499,"institutions_float_pct":0.47697,"institutions_n":58,"institutions":[],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0095,"shares":252887,"value":2604736,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.1595},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0072000003,"shares":192927,"value":1987148,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"DFA INVESTMENT TRUST CO-The Continental Small Company Series","pct":0.0046,"shares":121831,"value":1254859,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.042600002},{"name":"VANGUARD Intl Eqy. INDEX Fd.